        "original_id": "0bb181d3-c801-5d4e-a1e9-d3703d8ed0e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jing Tian, Jackie Chan, Ding Sheng, Jiang Zhuoyuan, Oho Ou\n- Works: The Warring States, Special ID, Police Story 2013, Fist & Faith\n- Topics: Chinese film, acting roles, film direction\n\nFacts:\n- Jing Tian was born on 21 July 1988 and is a Chinese actress.\n- Jing Tian is known for her role in the war epic The Warring States, which was released in 2011.\n- Police Story 2013, also known as Police Story: Lockdown, is a 2013 Chinese-Hong Kong action crime thriller film.\n- Police Story 2013 was directed and written by Ding Sheng and stars Jackie Chan in another reboot of the Police Story film series.\n- Jing Tian is known for her roles in the 2013 action films Special ID and Police Story 2013.\n- Fist & Faith, also titled 青禾男高, is a Chinese coming-of-age film directed by Jiang Zhuoyuan and starring Jing Tian and Oho Ou.",
